  "reason": "The existing evidence is entirely absent, so the first experiment should test a baseline multimodal configuration to establish whether combining RNA and image data improves performance. This experiment tests the impact of multimodal fusion (concat) with standard encoders (pca_n2000 for RNA, resnet50 for images) and no aggregation, which is a logical starting point to assess if multimodal approaches are beneficial. It addresses the critical design choice of fusion method and provides a reference for comparing more complex configurations later."
